  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given circuit, it is observed&nbsp;that the current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math> is independent of the value of resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>. Then, the resistance value must satisfy</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/2d404985-8a83-4f44-9f6a-e17b22cb3318-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 181px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "aLtnJ",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
